{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "3dbf14c1e12d6108259ead7436842e0b88cc0f60e335595552a05348a245ec06", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです、お待ちしてました♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了，我正在等你呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "55e4f222db81e21a6deba31ae7c4dbca6dd0965fc1cbf0ee88eccecb2bf5bed9", "ja": "お疲れさまです。青羽さんが俺を探していたと\nいうことは、もしかして……。", "zh": "辛苦了。青羽小姐在找我，\n是不是就代表……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "1c77da0123a6238447259c7368e515fa1dabb13c618fff2cc2796d7b50ee25cb", "ja": "はい！　社長さんから{$P$}さんに\nお話があるそうです。", "zh": "是的！社长似乎有话要\n对{$P$}先生说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "4064dce2a6569b30f76f4d8e630f8ef36864ccbff9959c7b32507288ace4249c", "ja": "ただ、今日は特に大事なお話みたいで……。\n音無先輩のテンションが、とっても高かったです！", "zh": "但是，今天似乎是特别重要的事……\n音无前辈的情绪也非常高昂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e8dd82f4a69f1cd823075fab7fce1d1ff1247e2b6dba1528825f773f66080966", "ja": "そ、そうなんですか？　どうしたんだろう……。\nとにかく、事務所に行ってみます！", "zh": "是、是这样啊？怎么一回事呢……\n总之我先去事务所看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "e1ac03609a7d16b6198a6582df7af3e011c348d81bebf5a53206c379cb7e21c8", "ja": "いってらっしゃ～い♪　あ、私にお手伝いできることが\nあったら、なんでも言ってくださいね～っ！", "zh": "路上小心～♪啊，如果有我能帮忙的事，\n请尽管跟我说喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1006_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "接着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ee7ae12a5e67326431839ac7d40be348105d85802089039bbfaa3cb026a43ff7", "ja": "失礼します！", "zh": "打扰了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "d4fa41e5d0c087569b75c16faeb8a18bb0bd7a99cd1ece0487d2dd7645df2de2", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nよかった、お待ちしていたんですよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n太好了，我们正在等你喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2069fdbd5cfb306642bf634de102a7b94e7ca5a7a9e73c70106182f720549bfc", "ja": "あ、お疲れ様です、音無さん。\n今日は何か、大事な話があるとか？", "zh": "啊，辛苦了，音无小姐，\n听说今天有什么重要的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "b49b35bfc4e3b32d2dd6cef78c83cbb4c654e9c72e0fb608df392c98afa9c821", "ja": "そうなんです！　なかなか来てくださらないから、もう\n気になっちゃって。仕事がはかどらなくて困りました♪", "zh": "没错！因为一直等不到你，结果我实在太介意，\n导致工作都没什么进展，真伤脑筋♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "444b2c398a6ba72c0c6138df186fe974f6abb8f1ff31cb5b6aec145425a39f07", "ja": "そうでしたか……。", "zh": "这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "41f81ceb6d4dfcdb0eb0a37de5330332bbd385657aa83f1ce785b92f10be2937", "ja": "おっほん！　ようやく来てくれたようだね。\nいや、私も仕事が手につかなくて困ったよ。はははは！", "zh": "咳咳！你终于来了呢。唉呀，\n连我也无法专心工作，真困扰呢，哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "b3ac83beb93531e3e5d2e4185dc661a37407ece553a6c48359471b46294e17e8", "ja": "さて、それはともかく……話というのは他でもない。\n765プロライブ劇場のことなんだが……。", "zh": "好了，先不说这个……我要说的不是别的，\n关于765艺能演唱会剧场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "f729265295624db2a8392cebaf3bd1686999733063d654201d90e4df86ddd6c2", "ja": "君とアイドル諸君の頑張りのおかげで、\n劇場は今、大いに盛り上がってる。", "zh": "多亏你和诸位偶像的努力，\n剧场现在非常热闹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "9a72ace510ca0fae7b22f3a0e67a567ef4eb60a04496d680e5fc13b80cecf991", "ja": "そこでだ。……この辺りでひとつ、\n新たなステージに進みたいと考えてるのだよ！", "zh": "所以说……我打算在这个时候，\n朝另一个新的阶段前进呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4ef6a69214715fbc3868d62addfd6e4f07630871ae03a09bb1b68af8181bf190", "ja": "新たなステージですか！\nそれはいったい……。", "zh": "新的阶段吗！\n那究竟是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "3ab9464aa312a8c1ed1f27857a6c6927dc1ac96a3ccfeca7ca9d774795c2944c", "ja": "うむ。アイドル諸君を3つのチームに分け、それぞれの\nチーム別に、お披露目公演を行おうと思っている！", "zh": "嗯，我打算把诸位偶像分为三队，\n让各分队进行首次亮相公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "5f153a8b5dd954c855d5252dad49d3c6e85f09494c64213fc3bdf9e1a2b48a00", "ja": "3つのチームに……！\nもしかして、お互いを競い合わせるために？", "zh": "分为三队……！\n该不会是为了让她们彼此竞争？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "b442c1302c0bd7165e66a8f1fa183c97735e88a7ad0bdff1d5120705bba3973c", "ja": "それだけではないがね。我が765プロのアイドル諸君\nは、互いに仲間でもあり、ライバルでもある。", "zh": "并不只是这样而已，我们765艺能的诸位偶像们，\n彼此之间既是伙伴，同时也是劲敌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "53a7fed076d233194879de0cc831eb1bdb0d1619f2cd57ca1ea8fabbabe946a7", "ja": "時には力を合わせ、時には競い合うことで、\n皆が最高の輝きを手にすることができる……。", "zh": "有时要同心协力，有时要相互竞争，\n大家借此才会散发最为闪耀的光辉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "217bfb1c191cc47a20c8ea2dae43854dc1f82784af8c0acdb37436ab28e4d7ed", "ja": "私は、そう信じているのだよ。", "zh": "我是这么相信着的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f2d1f024f1fc5bcf6054d4f81d562a8120b6db581dcf273bee04c39399c10dcc", "ja": "はい。彼女たちが成長するためにも、\n仲間と切磋琢磨することは欠かせないと思います。", "zh": "是的，这也是为了她们的成长，\n我认为和伙伴切磋琢磨是不可或缺的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "3c740468b4f5a11a97951765353d10c08bddc5cf80a72c0dd5fc7b33fc693d57", "ja": "君ならわかってくれると思っていたよ！\nというわけで、すでにチーム名も考えてある。音無君！", "zh": "我就知道你一定会懂！\n然后分队名我也已经想好了，音无！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "2cb7adb2864d88df0700d9a632f00d3b944c4952f1825c3a92586468abcb32ee", "ja": "はい♪　3つのチームの名前は、それぞれ……\nFairy、Angel、Princessです！", "zh": "是的♪三个分队的名字分别是……\nFairy、Angel以及Princess！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "2ef21d0d6d71e5d8fab16705fac22603b2a8fd682b512e200e7e628f25c8f1e7", "ja": "なるほど……いいですね！\nFairy、Angel、そしてPrincess……。", "zh": "原来如此……真不错呢！\nFairy、Angel，然后是Princess……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "b657663d006defcf76838c1287f8c98b251032781a6c8049d49ef32fd4248f1f", "ja": "あれ？　もしかして、こけら落とし公演の\nコンセプト候補から取ったんですか？", "zh": "咦？这难道是取自\n开幕公演的主题企划吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "23f0d8033d1b781363e11da54738931d9c4158d06602fadb9694b68a1f1f90a3", "ja": "その通り！　だからこそ、劇場のアイドル諸君の\nチーム名として相応しいだろう？", "zh": "正是！正因如此，\n才适合作为剧场诸位偶像的分队名对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "22052f5f8cfcbb1f6fd087971c26381c3c7fabcf90073f2a00d7b0290cc8b180", "ja": "とってもアイドルらしく、素敵だと思いますよ♪", "zh": "非常有偶像的风格，我认为很棒喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "847192025a6a291e53d1d736067e024b7e6c17c8f59f8ed265c0be1456c4bae5", "ja": "ちなみに、誰がどのチームかについては、アイドルの\nみんなのカード一覧などで確認してくださいね♪", "zh": "顺带一提，请在各位偶像的卡片一览等功能，\n确认谁是属于哪个分队喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1030_101kot", "source_sha256": "c63fc2b3e5334ea9a53499029ea928981497af59c090bae47b1b418bb9563910", "ja": "イメージカラーで言うと、\n赤がPrincess、青がFairy、黄色がAngelです！", "zh": "如果以印象色来说，\n红色是Princess、蓝色是Fairy，而黄色是Angel！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "845e8f3315986d5948ef927d7e7b79090e35e41fb6e97b9bef6061351340769b", "ja": "そしてさらにだ！　それぞれのチームのために、\n新曲を3曲、用意するつもりだ！", "zh": "接着就是！我打算为每个分队\n各准备三首新歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "cd9cd9d73c0d43b463f4c1c91335992a21a47ece9a4dcc7fca4bf2c776989d2a", "ja": "新曲を！　それはつまり……\n各チームのテーマソング、というわけですね？", "zh": "准备新歌！也就是说……\n新歌是各分队的主题曲吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1033_president", "source_sha256": "f41c09936b15e753211bb2abd8cc4c5e1df4a8e25da104e8ac63ef4ef636336d", "ja": "そうだ。これらの新曲は、\nそのチーム全員のための曲、ということになる。", "zh": "没错，这些新歌就是为了\n该分队全体成员所作的歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1034_101kot", "source_sha256": "eba8d21d3f7f9107026ec5da8e3c5afb7b6221969c3f2e32fa3c197b40a7b1e5", "ja": "お披露目公演では、新曲を歌うメンバーを5人選んで、\nオープニング曲として歌ってもらいたいそうです♪", "zh": "首次亮相公演中，似乎会选出五位成员\n来演唱新歌，当作开场曲♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1035_p", "source_sha256": "6085b8563bb8dcdcbf4e2c731e5a971934c1fed23abea24e65ef56195995da17", "ja": "（お披露目公演に選抜メンバー、それに新曲！\n……これはすごい公演になりそうだ！）", "zh": "（首次亮相公演、选拔成员，还有新歌！\n……看来这次公演会很精彩呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1036_president", "source_sha256": "2d0b1d2026fcd38b4f13bf0bbae70aacb83cf3079729598ab14a7a65e79ef562", "ja": "そして、そのお披露目公演だが……。\nまずは、Fairyチームから始めるつもりだ！", "zh": "接着，关于这首次亮相公演……\n我打算由Fairy队先开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1037_president", "source_sha256": "794199af367fb64946b06ec87f1da25bb28a370e25eb67486cbe2e83c186ae92", "ja": "その公演で新曲を歌ってもらうのは、最上静香君、\n所恵美君、北沢志保君、ジュリア君、白石紬君の5名！", "zh": "要在这场公演上演唱新歌的是最上静香、\n所惠美、北泽志保、茱莉亚和白石䌷这五位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1038_president", "source_sha256": "d1839d96d917935274946146685ecffb29e57e467803d673d8aff7d499bae414", "ja": "新曲を歌うユニットの名前は『FAIRY STARS』！\n今回のFAIRY STARSは彼女達5人、というわけだ！", "zh": "演唱新歌的团体名称是『FAIRY STARS』！\n意思就是，这次的FAIRY STARS是她们五个人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1039_p", "source_sha256": "a6c5f7062acfc8e88b21d1cc3e9d414bcc98e16ef5d7348b017126ac3418bb7f", "ja": "（……つまり、誰が選ばれて誰が歌っても、\nこの曲は『FAIRY STARS』の曲、ってことか）", "zh": "（……也就是说，无论选出了谁、由谁来唱，\n这首歌都是属于『FAIRY STARS』的歌吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1040_president", "source_sha256": "2778d1d04e08b4ee5d01ea1c0a297886838398bdb76a8a74384ca8aee204b8e1", "ja": "さて、あらためて聞いておこう。この新たな\nシリーズ公演の采配……引き受けてくれるかね？", "zh": "好了，那我正式问一次吧，\n你愿意接下……这新系列公演的指挥之职吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_1041", "source_sha256": "b9651974dd46b4b0b61191e0de4bfcb9428141bf41b768751e920af2780cd7e7", "ja": "もちろんです", "zh": "当然", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "a7d944df1fc1db2acc038232ab7ba47731c969d49be82c23563ed2a035178ca9", "ja": "もちろんです！　必ず成功させてみせます！", "zh": "当然！我一定会让公演成功的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "e8e99b07ad7cf2dd23a5468ed9ca2119beb9d8c07bbe301d9d81e017c2e61778", "ja": "うむ、君ならそう言ってくれると思っていた！\nそれじゃ、よろしく頼んだよ～！", "zh": "嗯，我就知道你会这么说！\n那就交给你了喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_2002_101kot", "source_sha256": "9cef9fe6d475fb812deb341485ac818d4bfaac46cfafce7431d3af8fd8cd9593", "ja": "ふふっ、大忙しですね、{$P$}さん。\n新しい公演、私も楽しみにしてます♪", "zh": "呵呵，会很忙碌呢，{$P$}先生。\n我也非常期待新公演喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "02fb921253af48a22bb65258f200698ea2725b9b66bfe2f4a25c89aec897fe42", "ja": "（3チームのお披露目公演か。公演準備に、\nチームメンバー全員レッスン……）", "zh": "（三个分队的首次亮相公演啊。为了准备公演，\n分队所有成员要进行训练课程……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_intro_2004_p", "source_sha256": "b282d44eceeb176fc98b388ff4013547dc6b712a49bb06b31fbe0131b9059310", "ja": "（やることは盛りだくさんだな。\nよし、まずはみんなに伝えないと！）", "zh": "（有好多事该做呢，\n好，首先要先告知大家才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
